 "note": "B2 (max print): printed straight bevel pair - geometry search + tooth strength.\n\nMethod\n  * Tredgold virtual spur gear: z_v = z / cos(delta), module = mean module m_m = m (1 - 0.5 b / R).\n  * Tooth form generated numerically by a basic rack (pressure angle alpha, addendum (1 + x) m, dedendum (1.25 - x) m,\n    rack tip radius rho = 0.38 m -> full root fillet) rolled over the virtual gear (raster simulation, 2-D).\n  * Lewis form factor from the generated tooth: load at the tip along the line of action, section width t(y) across the\n    tooth, Y = min_y t(y)^2 / (6 l(y) m)  (inscribed-parabola criterion), sigma = Ft / (b m_m Y).\n  * Dolan-Broghamer fillet factor Kf (AGMA) reported separately (conservative short-term check).\n  * Envelope limits for the NOVA left shoulder (frame B, apex O = (39, 3, -17)):\n      pinion crown radius <= 4.70 (pan/lift sweep r 33.4 about Z + 1.0 mm; vertical axis 39.115 from Z),\n      gear crown radius <= 6.9 (plug cavity r 7.3, plug screw holes at r 9.0, D2.2),\n      ratio 1.0 .. 1.67 (servo 300 deg must give the arm >= 180 deg).\nwrites gears.json\n",
